{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0093_1000_001har", "source_sha256": "e9a9fb6ad20aa3ffb48a777ccec0f2cad0ce817031a9ee20c0d0eecafe6b1572", "ja": "{$P$}さん、お疲れ様です。\nあの……、よかったらクッキー食べませんか？", "zh": "{$P$}先生，你辛苦了。\n那个……方便的话，要不要一起吃饼干？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0093_1001_001har", "source_sha256": "5d11ab05c7b63e423e911d0153341d099db85e1cb449b86848472c97d90ad3f6", "ja": "差し入れにと思って作ってきたんです。\n今回はキレイに焼けたから、自信作なんですよ♪", "zh": "我想说你工作很辛苦，所以做了点慰劳品。\n这次烤得很漂亮，可是我的得意之作呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0093_1002", "source_sha256": "72581708f4a5c9f944f2121956fbfb746fd61b265cb305e76f64a4a968f4a7f8", "ja": "受け取る", "zh": "收下", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0093_1024_p", "source_sha256": "8fe847cf0071fe231ab7c4710a652a3d3c0c2713aa493417fd153cd90ad5bb57", "ja": "ああ、いつもありがとうな。じゃあ、さっそく1枚\nいただこう。……もぐもぐ。うん、おいしい！", "zh": "嗯，谢谢你总是对我那么好。\n那我就再来一片……（嚼嚼嚼）嗯，真好吃！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0093_1003_001har", "source_sha256": "d8ad1fc96d2328ba3a0e22fa827bd6a67d3b2675c97531a3e2123946b857c606", "ja": "えへへ、やったぁ♪　たくさん食べてくださいね！\n今日のクッキーは、桜の花びらが入ってるんです。", "zh": "嘿嘿，太好了♪请你要多吃点！\n今天的饼干，我还加了樱花花瓣呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0093_1004_p", "source_sha256": "bfc4e9db911ac4cc77516043746a9369b90f79653f0421603dcab92838f81e65", "ja": "桜か……。この前のライブを思い出すな。そういえば\nあの時もクッキーを焼いてきてくれたっけ……もぐ。", "zh": "樱花啊……让我想起之前的演唱会。\n说起来，那时你也有烤饼干给我吃吧……（嚼嚼）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0093_1005_001har", "source_sha256": "6daa0e35fc4f738f88fff0156042313739f1ef56c399c40707ec4e3427af39ec", "ja": "わぁ……！　覚えててくれたんですね、\n{$P$}さん！", "zh": "哇……！你还记得呀，\n{$P$}先生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0093_1006_p", "source_sha256": "63c78635fa2bd5fe9b47c8de57a091cd89ad51d6857ed6163d7a6991c57499fb", "ja": "（満開の桜の下でのライブ。春香がしっかりレッスン\nできたおかげか、盛り上がったな……もぐもぐ）", "zh": "（演唱会在盛开的樱花树下举办，大概是因为\n春香训练很认真，观众反应相当热烈呢……嚼嚼嚼）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0093_1007_001har", "source_sha256": "659addd7ece88253bdfc7f2228c36df7445427c6145a1db63d50abd466e766c6", "ja": "あの時って、じつはちょっと、\n失敗しちゃったりもしたんですよね～。えへへっ。", "zh": "那个时候啊，其实我……\n有出点小错呢～嘿嘿！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0093_1008_p", "source_sha256": "c0eb03f9ddaeffcea208d83fd0cf4c6d27fb158efc81b49dc49fbc9e5b6d8916", "ja": "失敗？　気にならなかったけどな。\n完ぺきだったと思うよ……うまいな、もぐもぐ。", "zh": "出错？我都没发现耶。\n我以为很完美说……这饼干很好吃呢（嚼嚼嚼）。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0093_1009_001har", "source_sha256": "402ba699f4f90575c4dfb4bb4805e356cc0b830b821cdaf99d8bc7aabfd2b927", "ja": "完ぺき……！　ほ、ホントですか！？", "zh": "完美……！你、你是说真的吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0093_1010_p", "source_sha256": "48ea37444d52270bd8afb3adaf24d820860cf2c3be246a36423f99c64052e521", "ja": "ああ。春香がたくさん練習した成果だよな！\n……もぐ。", "zh": "是啊，那可是春香辛苦练习的成果呢！\n……（嚼嚼嚼）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0093_1011_001har", "source_sha256": "1e1dcea3cd47b6868d5d8b7ae8bc44a89171cb14e43a914dc448ad530aa63f3d", "ja": "え？　練習のことも、知ってたんですか……？\nあっ、よかったらおかわりもどうぞ！　はいっ。", "zh": "咦？你连我练习的状况也知道吗……？\n啊，不介意的话这里还有！请用！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0093_1012_p", "source_sha256": "d560060ccf10bd7cdf9d3b4f1ea63791b6934e0373039577b718fab8bc2bed22", "ja": "ありがとう。じゃあ、遠慮なく……もぐもぐ。\n……もちろん知ってるさ。プロデューサーだからな。", "zh": "谢谢，那我就不客气了……（嚼嚼嚼）\n……我当然知道啰，毕竟我是制作人嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0093_1013_001har", "source_sha256": "60a8899e44d58b246afa7731749767eb23a8b38c725d7b577c8d7b6ec2759ceb", "ja": "{$P$}さん……。も、もう、\nなんでもお見通しだなんて、ずるいなぁ。", "zh": "{$P$}先生……\n真、真是的，不管什么会被你看穿，这样太狡猾了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0093_1014_001har", "source_sha256": "35dfa382ee60302293b7f0458c43a6b4862654345fec93d229e1d904f18bfb9c", "ja": "でも、ありがとうございます。\nあの……私、これからも、たくさんがんばりますね。", "zh": "不过，谢谢你。\n那个……我今后也会好好努力的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0093_1015_001har", "source_sha256": "27d3653b916738472ee83e75321db8b9f45a08926e5d2ecf4cea34040cb17f14", "ja": "だから、その……。\nこれからも、たくさん受け取ってください♪", "zh": "所以……\n未来也要请你多多收下我的心意喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0093_1016_p", "source_sha256": "3625f6051b59cf9ac799bd051724a751344a7252e3e733998659d9a68cdfe62e", "ja": "もぐ？　……いや、嬉しいけど、\nさすがにそれはできないよ。", "zh": "（嚼嚼嚼）？……不，你有这个心我是很高兴啦，\n但我不能接受你的好意。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0093_1017_001har", "source_sha256": "8ab73f0294f7d14c77a27ff22483370561e7d7ebac0ae86c4c50d322a916254f", "ja": "ええっ！？　だ……、ダメ、ですか？", "zh": "咦咦！？不……不行吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0093_1018_p", "source_sha256": "566ad3e6b0d94576b6d754ab51a0f33fb35f10e980635bbf5454ac0863bb13a1", "ja": "ああ、ライブは俺じゃなくて、ファンのみんなに受け\n取ってもらわないと。春香も、本当はわかってるだろ？", "zh": "是啊，因为你的表演应该给粉丝们看，\n而不是给我看才对。春香，这点你自己也明白吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0093_1019_001har", "source_sha256": "b9e6385ed5dd8774647be7a24309508c8fa6a739eb3ba0c783cc63845137cfc4", "ja": "はい………そうですよね。\nファンのみんなに、ライブ……。あれ？", "zh": "嗯……说得也是。\n我的表演应该给粉丝们看……咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0093_1020_001har", "source_sha256": "d6b7f9446389190d4416e5e00f17c887ef0a6f5f76fb0bdbc15b421d7335f36d", "ja": "ライブ？　……クッキーの話じゃなくて、ライブ？\n……そっか。……あはっ、あははっ！", "zh": "表演……你刚刚是在说表演，而不是饼干？\n……原来是这样……啊哈、啊哈哈！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0093_1021_p", "source_sha256": "4aa011ecb59b338c5cf589a21869febadec2507e7a2db776b99a70021beda8f2", "ja": "（もぐもぐ……ごくん。\nびっくりするほど、おいしかった……）", "zh": "（嚼嚼嚼……我吞。\n这饼干真是好吃得不得了……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0093_1022_p", "source_sha256": "586c08474ed207b8f64a61174ec9dc91010bda4413eb745513fe0c0aec6cd37e", "ja": "ところで春香、もしよかったら、でいいんだけど……。\nこのクッキー、また作ってきてもらえないかな？", "zh": "是说春香，如果你愿意的话……\n之后还能再烤这种饼干给我吃吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0093_1023_001har", "source_sha256": "e5f719e2938958d18a504588bc690ca88e4f311b0aa5837043b7f0af8d66893b", "ja": "……はいっ、もちろんです♪　ライブと同じくらい、\nたくさん練習しておきますね！　えへへっ♪", "zh": "……嗯！当然没问题♪我会像准备演唱会一样，\n认真练习的！嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
